<title>USA: Ascent buys Upsher-Smith's Feverall line.</title>
<headline>Ascent buys Upsher-Smith's Feverall line.</headline>
<dateline>WILMINGTON, Mass. 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ascent Pediatrics Inc on Friday said it completed the purchase of Upsher-Smith's Feverall line for treating pain and fever in children.</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction were not disclosed in the company's statement.</p>
<p>Ascent, a drug development and marketing company focused exclusively on pediatric treatments, will begin marketing the product this fall.</p>
<p>	  (( --New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
